# The 4+ striation is exact (CR 721.2a-b): three charge counters from three Memnites leave U.S.S. Prometheus, Prototype a plain
# artifact - no creature, no flying, no power - and the fourth makes it an artifact creature 6/6 with flying in addition to its
# types. The 6/6 is the station box, so it is the base power and toughness a layer 7b setting them gives.

